    "answer": "Ekran is an arthouse cinema at 30 Navoi Street in Tashkent with two screens of 120 and 48 seats and shows daily from 11:00 to midnight. Tickets are 45,000 sum in the daytime and 65,000 sum in the evening; a 10-film pass is 500,000 sum. Films play in the original language with subtitles, and the film club meets on Thursdays."
